  "description": "It seems my brother’s fiancée is having an affair with a coworker. Determined to stop the wedding within two months, Ian goes undercover, taking a job as the personal secretary to the CEO of the company where her future sister-in-law works.\n\n*\"Do you think boundaries exist just to be crossed?\"*\n\nUnfortunately for her, that CEO is Cha Jeonghan, a man as strikingly handsome as he is utterly unbearable. With his cutting remarks and infuriating composure, he makes it his personal mission to provoke Ian at every turn.\n\n*\"Yes. Boundaries exist to be crossed.\"*\n\nWith nothing to lose, not even her job, Ian decides to trample over Jeonghan’s carefully drawn lines whenever she pleases. And slowly, the once-arrogant man who never deigned to look down from his lofty pedestal begins to falter.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
